	"identifying_description": "Woman's cocktail ensemble: (a) white wool felt coat with low scoop neckline and gathered skirt, peplum at waist; neckline is crocheted with red, blue, and green wool tassels; lace appliqué on skirt. Multi-colored goat hair cuffs; front closure with six hidden hooks and eyes; fully lined in off white silk charmeuse; label: \"Christian Lacroix/Paris\"; (b) sleeveless scoop neck dress of heavy purple wool bouclé over boned petticoat; attached multi-layer necklace of metal coins and crystal-studded balls and beads; label: \"Christian Lacroix/Paris\"",
